Package: bricohams-qo100
Version: @VERSION@
Section: hamradio
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Depends: libc6
Recommends: sdrangel, tqsl
Maintainer: BricoHams <noreply@bricohams.invalid>
Homepage: https://github.com/BricoHams/BricoHams-QO100-Station
Description: BricoHams QO-100 station (headless server)
 Remote TX/RX web control for a QO-100 station on top of SDRangel.
 Bundles its own Node.js runtime. Transmission stays disabled until
 the station owner enables it in /etc/bricohams-qo100/config.json.
